02:40.03,0:02:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me! What kind of doctor carries a sword around?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you make house calls by submarine or something?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Who is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law...Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,A rookie from the North Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:03:00.53,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm remembering right, he's a pirate who teamed up with Straw Hat Luffy and got away...Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:03.63,Main,,0,0,0,,after the Celestial Dragon incident on the Sabaody Archipelago the other day!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've come to save him in their submarine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't waste any more time! Hand him over!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you who the hell you are and why I should trust you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Law! Warships are approaching off the stern!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Bring both of them over here!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Calling all Navy soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:36.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Split into two forces:Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:40.05,Main,,0,0,0,,push back the Whitebeard Pirates' attack,  and suppress the Blackbeard Pirates' ambush!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Marines are coming up from underground!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,They had a path down there?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got backup! All right! Take them out immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.79,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:38.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What an extraordinary power!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I said I'll never let him escape!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:47.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He's putting on a pretty fantastic show, once again.Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:05:00.68,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't control it too well yet.Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain! If you get too carried away, we'll lose our footing as well!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sengoku the Buddha?! Garp the Hero?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you stop me?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Your era ended with Whitebeard's!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What's Blackbeard doing now?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:39.49,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Warning! Due to the earthquake that struck Marineford...Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:44.37,Main,,0,0,0,,we are issuing a tsunami warning for the south coast of Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We assure you there is no cause for panic, please remain calm.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:57.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Please take shelter in the elevated areas of Groves 40 to 50, on the northern side of the archipelago.Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! What are you waiting for?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a noble! I'll pay you, just let me go first!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please remain calm.Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pacifista have crossed the chasm in the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow the Pacifista! Don't let the pirates escape, men!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.47,0:06:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know! But I'm so sad!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Sad?Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I can hear voices in my head...Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:07:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,disappearing, one by one...Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:08.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Voices?Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We'll show you Navy justice!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:13.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Is this your idea of justice?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:22.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's for my friend who died in the war!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:26.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Damn pirate! Go to Hell!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:35.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to make them understand! The rulers of the sea are not the pirates, but us!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:36.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I did it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of nonsense are you spouting?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you gone crazy? Get a hold of yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:43.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,H-Help me...Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Koby!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:56.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,As many of us must escape as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there! You can still be saved!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We must get him treated!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I... I don't want to die...Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Abandon him! We're at war here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,B-But Sir...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the time to show the power of the Navy... of justice!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no time to tend to the wounded!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes Sir!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Chase down the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill every last one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone, help him! Anyone!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Destroy the pirates! Don't leave a single one alive!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:40.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The killing won't stop... The marines have accomplished their goals, but are far more brutal now!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:47.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Our bullets don't work!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Chase them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:51.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn villains!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:56.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong... with our "justice" and "evil"...Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Both sides are acting in their own self-interests.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:08:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men! As long as you are marines...Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.69,Main,,0,0,0,,you must never forgive the evil we know as pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody can stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy everything and swallow it up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Just leave Straw Hat Luffy behind.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Kizaru!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:37.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get them over here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll leave them with you, whoever you are!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Do what you can!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch them, Jean Bart!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's dive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:55.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You did well to escape from me on Sabaody, Trafalgar Law...Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He's horribly injured! Is he still alive?Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:10:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give it up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:16.03,Main,,0,0,0,,A marine?Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Koby!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, already! All this fighting, just end it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with him?Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Someone...Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Help us...Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:47.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We're throwing people's lives away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though every single soldier has a family waiting for them to return!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though we've already accomplished our goal!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep chasing pirates who don't want to fight, drawing out a battle that should already be over...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,and abandoning soldiers who could be saved if we treat their wounds now!Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,And still, we're sacrificing even more people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What about the soldiers who will fall after this?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Koby?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We're making them look like idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You've wasted several seconds of my time. The Navy has no use for soldiers who aren't righteous!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless... I'm gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:40.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But... I said it! I said what I wanted to say!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:44.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:04.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You did well, young marine.Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You risked your life to create a brief moment of courage...Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,for better or worse, that has greatly changed the fate of the world.Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry and bring him inside!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:20.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything, Kizaru.Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my... Benn Beckman...Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's... that ship is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Cast off!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:36.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,one of the Four Emperors of the New World doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Red Hair Shanks!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I've come...Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,to end this war!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Red Hair...Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:26.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The one who put Luffy on the path to become a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:46.35,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Red Hair Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The skirmish between Emperors Kaido and Red Hair was just a few days ago in the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,He made it all the way here already?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:04.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shanks?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Your straw hat?Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:18.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I had a treasure map I wanted to give you, too...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:26.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It leads to a great treasure trove!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's way too good to be true! You think you can fool me with a story like that?Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll just give it to someone else, then.Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wha-?! Oh, crap, wait! I'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to him right away!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen Luffy for ten years!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to take a look at him?Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! This is dangerous!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I know it's rare to see one of the Four Emperors, but hurry and close the doors!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You forgot this! Here, catch!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's flying towards us.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! Hurry! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I would like to see him, but...Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm entrusting you with this hat.Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:48.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Make sure you give it back one day...Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:51.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,once you've become a great pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:54.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's a promise, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.15,0:16:12.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If we met now...Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,it would break our promise, wouldn't it...Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:20.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This should be a fun operation.Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Red Hair, you scum!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You let Dragon's son escape!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:45.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice Age!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,He's after the submarine!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The water is freezing over!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,His pulse is starting to stabilize.Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What now?Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:11.31,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency! The ice is closing in on us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll dive quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got away...Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We're safe...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yasakani Sacred Jewel!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What is it now?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got to go deeper! To the ocean floor!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:04.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get hit! We're definitely gonna get hit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Full speed ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:22.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it... They just won't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.93,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't hit them, did he?Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's brother! Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,If they're still alive now...Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,then they're really lucky.Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:39.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to give up on them for now...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is that warship sailing out alone?Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You must hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow the submarine!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow it? But it's at the bottom of the ocean!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I doubt it even survived the Admirals' attacks just now...Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No. They are, without a doubt, alive.Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen well!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,As one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea,Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall definitely chase down Straw Hat Luffy and finish him off!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Report this to the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes Ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:23.19,Main,,0,0,0,,B-But where should we go?Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Just advance!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:29.11,Main,,0,0,0,,She's crazy, yet so beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:35.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:38.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You were lying about the treasure map?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,D-D-Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:44.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a spur of the moment thing, Buggy.Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What do you meanDialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,"It's been a long time, huh?"Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I still hold a grudge against you, Shanks!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,About what?Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shouted at me back then,Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have lost that treasure map, nor would I have Devil Fruit powers!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you meant?Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.09,0:20:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the great reaction.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I've always hated this side of you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:31.05,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as we were reunited you took advantage of me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:34.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you've come to end this war, or whatever...Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to start a one-on-one war with you right now!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:45.93,Main,,0,0,0,,He's talking to Red Hair Shanks, one of the Four Emperors...Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,with that attitude!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.93,0:20:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We will follow you...Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.23,Main,,0,0,0,,forever!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, I got it. Don't get upset.Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:08.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But wait a second...Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.67,0:21:14.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,as long as I'm with these guys, I can get off this island safely!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:21.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Red Hair...Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco.Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't continue this fight any longer.Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Just pull back quietly.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk-Eye!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:43.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I agreed to fight Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Fighting Red Hair was not part of the agreement.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:55.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If you keep on fighting...Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.45,0:22:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,both sides will suffer more pointless casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,If anybody still wants to fight...Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:16.99,Main,,0,0,0,,then come! We will be your opponents!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Teach?Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:40.73,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Blackbeard!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's stop for now.Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I got what I wanted.Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:52.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's still too soon for us to fight you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.51,0:23:37.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone...Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.35,0:23:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,for now...Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,please listen to what I have to say.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.51,0:24:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Here's the final news report...Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.33,0:24:36.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard. Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.05,0:24:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Please leave their burial to us.Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.74,0:24:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,This war was broadcast all over the world.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't exploit their deaths more than you already have!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.93,0:24:54.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What selfish crap are you spouting?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.51,0:24:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Holding their heads up to the world will be the symbol of our victory!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.35,0:25:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The Vice Admiral is right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to disgrace our victory?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:05.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't obey the orders of a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.91,0:25:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well.Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.93,0:25:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.44,0:25:18.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with entrusting them to you, Red Hair.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.19,0:25:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Sir!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.03,0:25:22.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I will take the blame.Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.26,0:25:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Tend to the wounds of the fallen!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.75,0:25:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,This war...Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,is over!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.79,0:25:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone who can move, help the medical staff!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Start with the ones who are heavily injured!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't suffer any more casualties on this battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:01.17,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so...Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:06.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the greatest battle since the curtain first rose on the Great Age of Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:11.38,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the great war of Marineford, came to an end.Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.38,0:26:14.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Engraving its place in history.Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.41,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:36.22,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control Grug PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:41.19,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:46.93,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:52.36,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:57.44,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.08,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.56,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.68,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws NetflixDialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.77,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.77,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.65,0:00:25.47,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.87,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.59,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:00: